{
    "test_name": "MOB.470_Header_Status_Icons",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.470_Header_Status_Icons",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.470` The header's status icons, version string and crew shortcut (T3.2).\n- READ-ONLY. The crew modal is opened and dismissed with Escape; nothing is submitted,\n  so no crew changes (unlike `MOB.200`).\n- **The version string is the reason this test exists.** `Version: ` +\n  `window.__mentorapm.shortVersion` is the only place a synthetic run can see which\n  build is live \u2014 the cheapest real deploy signal available \u2014 and nothing asserted it.\n  Checked twice: the rendered prefix, and a JS read proving the value behind it is\n  non-empty, because `'Version: ' + undefined` still renders the prefix (trap 5).\n- **Network icon:** the ONLINE half is provable here (`wifi` present *and*\n  `wifi-slash` absent, so a component stuck offline fails). The offline half needs the\n  network toggled off \u2014 Appendix C.\n- **Pending-transaction icon:** `if (!count) return null`, and the count is always 0\n  while online, so the only online assertion is absence. That proves the `!count`\n  branch and nothing else \u2014 stated plainly rather than dressed up (trap 5).\n- **The upload icon is deliberately not tested.** It is rendered as\n  `{!!window.ReactNativeWebView && <UploadStatusIcon />}`, so it never mounts in a\n  browser (T1.7). The checklist had carried it as open work blocked on \"an in-flight\n  upload\"; the real blocker was one line higher up. The absence of the bridge is\n  asserted so that reasoning is checked, not assumed.\n- **The crew shortcut is a second entry point** to the modal `MOB.430` reaches from the\n  menu \u2014 `<span class=\"mobile-crew\">` beside the logo.\n- Icon names were **measured** (trap 14): `wifi`, `wifi-slash`, `upload`, `code-fork`.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Menu",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
            "device_ids": [
                "chrome.tablet"
            ],
            "disable_cors": false,
            "disable_csp": false,
            "ignore_server_certificate_error": false,
            "min_failure_duration": 0,
            "min_location_failed": 1,
            "monitor_options": {},
            "no_screenshot": false,
            "retry": {
                "count": 1,
                "interval": 300.0
            },
            "rum_settings": {
                "is_enabled": false
            },
            "tick_every": 86400
        },
        "steps": [
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Navigate to the mobile home page",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/"
                },
                "type": "goToUrl"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let the app shell and GET_SESSION settle",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 5
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "NETWORK: the online wifi icon is rendered",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//*[@data-icon=\"wifi\" or contains(concat(\" \", normalize-space(@class), \" \"), \" fa-wifi \")]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementPresent",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "NETWORK: the OFFLINE icon is not \u2014 the pair is what makes this a real check",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return !document.querySelector('[data-icon=\"wifi-slash\"], .fa-wifi-slash');"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Sanity: the runner really is online (navigator.onLine)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return navigator.onLine === true;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "PENDING TX: no upload icon while online \u2014 the `!count` branch",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return !document.querySelector('[data-icon=\"upload\"], .fa-upload');"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "The ReactNativeWebView bridge is absent, so UploadStatusIcon cannot mount",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return !window.ReactNativeWebView;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Open the header menu",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//button[@aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\"]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "click",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Wait for the menu",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "VERSION: the menu renders a version item",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "Version: "
                },
                "type": "assertPageContains"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "VERSION: it carries the code-fork icon",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//*[@data-icon=\"code-fork\" or contains(concat(\" \", normalize-space(@class), \" \"), \" fa-code-fork \")]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementPresent",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "PROOF: the version has a real value \u2014 'Version: ' + undefined renders too",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "const v = window.__mentorapm && window.__mentorapm.shortVersion;\nif (!v || !String(v).trim()) return false;\n// and the DOM must actually be showing that value, not just the prefix\nreturn (document.body.innerText || '').includes('Version: ' + v);"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Close the menu",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "Escape"
                },
                "type": "pressKey"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "SW: navigator.serviceWorker is available",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return 'serviceWorker' in navigator;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 15
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "SW: a service worker is CONTROLLING this page \u2014 not merely present",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return !!(navigator.serviceWorker && navigator.serviceWorker.controller);"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "SW: kick off getRegistrations() (async \u2014 read in the next step)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "window.__ddSW = 'pending';\ntry { navigator.serviceWorker.getRegistrations()\n  .then(function (r) { window.__ddSW = r.length; })\n  .catch(function () { window.__ddSW = -1; }); } catch (e) { window.__ddSW = -2; }\nreturn true;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 15
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let getRegistrations() settle",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 3
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "SW: at least one service worker is REGISTERED (numeric, so a still-pending promise fails rather than passing)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return typeof window.__ddSW === 'number' && window.__ddSW > 0;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 15
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
